    {
      "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-360ab",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "360AB Associate",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2024a00036#sch-1-sec-360ab"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2024a00036.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2024a00036.pdf, p.9",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, an associate of a person (the first\nperson) in relation to control of:\n(a) a facility; or\n(b) a company;\nis:\n(c) a partner of the first person; or\n(d) if the first person or another person who is an associate of the\nfirst person under another paragraph receives benefits or is\n\nSchedule 1  Statutory infrastructure providers",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, an associate of a person (the first\nperson) in relation to control of:\n(a) a facility; or\n(b) a company;\nis:\n(c) a partner of the first person; or\n(d) if the first person or another person who is an associate of the\nfirst person under another paragraph receives benefits or is\n\nSchedule 1  Statutory infrastructure providers",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-360ab-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-360ab-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "cc844537f9e318a27dd7c918298fe835fd9ac093109a63a4f5f4ba748be458b4",
      "skos:note": "Associate definition for control of facility or company"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2024a00036#sch-1-sec-360ab",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "360AB Associate",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 9,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, an associate of a person (the first\nperson) in relation to control of:\n(a) a facility; or\n(b) a company;\nis:\n(c) a partner of the first person; or\n(d) if the first person or another person who is an associate of the\nfirst person under another paragraph receives benefits or is\n\nSchedule 1  Statutory infrastructure providers"
    },
    {
