      "cml:conclusionText": "...an associate of a person (the first person)..."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-360ac",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "360AC Control",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2024a00036#sch-1-sec-360ac"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2024a00036.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2024a00036.pdf, p.10",
      "values:originalText": "In this Part, control includes control as a result of, or by means of,\ntrusts, agreements, arrangements, understandings and practices,\nwhether or not having legal or equitable force and whether or not\nbased on legal or equitable rights.\n\nStatutory infrastructure providers  Schedule 1\nAmendments  Part 1\nNo. 36, 2024\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Enhancing Consumer\nSafeguards and Other Measures) Act 2024",
      "skos:definition": "In this Part, control includes control as a result of, or by means of,\ntrusts, agreements, arrangements, understandings and practices,\nwhether or not having legal or equitable force and whether or not\nbased on legal or equitable rights.\n\nStatutory infrastructure providers  Schedule 1\nAmendments  Part 1\nNo. 36, 2024\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Enhancing Consumer\nSafeguards and Other Measures) Act 2024",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-360ac-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e8bb3bb28de4d03055520e4222b2da3e855036ea8d8ae6c5c2993a5e909334ba",
      "skos:note": "Control includes control as a result of, or by means of, trusts, agreements, arrangements, understandings and practices."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2024a00036#sch-1-sec-360ac",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "360AC Control",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 10,
      "values:originalText": "In this Part, control includes control as a result of, or by means of,\ntrusts, agreements, arrangements, understandings and practices,\nwhether or not having legal or equitable force and whether or not\nbased on legal or equitable rights.\n\nStatutory infrastructure providers  Schedule 1\nAmendments  Part 1\nNo. 36, 2024\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Enhancing Consumer\nSafeguards and Other Measures) Act 2024"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-360ac-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
