      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 11,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of this Part, the question of whether a person is in\na position to exercise control of a company is to be determined\nunder Schedule 1 to the Broadcasting Services Act 1992."
    },
    {
