      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-360b",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "360B Simplified outline of this Division",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2024a00036#sch-1-sec-360b"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2024a00036.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2024a00036.pdf, p.12",
      "values:originalText": "•\nThere are 4 types of service area, as follows:\n(a)\nthe general service area;\n(b)\na nominated service area;\n(c)\nan anticipated service area;\n\nStatutory infrastructure providers  Schedule 1\nAmendments  Part 1\nNo. 36, 2024\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Enhancing Consumer\nSafeguards and Other Measures) Act 2024\n(d)\na designated service area.\n•\nNBN Co is the statutory infrastructure provider for the general\nservice area.\n•\nA nominated service area is an area that is attributable to:\n(a)\na declaration made by a carrier or carriage service\nprovider; or\n(b)\ncertain carrier licence conditions declarations made by\nthe Minister.\n•\nThe statutory infrastructure provider for a nominated service\narea that is attributable to a declaration made by a carrier or\ncarriage service provider will be:\n(a)\nthe carrier or carriage service provider; or\n(b)\nanother carrier or carriage service provider declared by\nthe Minister.\n•\nThe statutory infrastructure provider for a nominated service\narea that is attributable to a carrier licence conditions\ndeclaration will be:\n(a)\nthe carrier to whom the carrier licence conditions\ndeclaration applies; or\n(b)\nanother carrier declared by the Minister.\n•\nAn anticipated service area is an area that is attributable to a\nnotice given by a carrier or carriage service provider.\n•\nThe statutory infrastructure provider for an anticipated service\narea that is attributable to a notice given by a carrier or\ncarriage service provider will be:\n(a)\nthe carrier or carriage service provider; or\n(b)\nanother carrier or carriage service provider declared by\nthe Minister.\n•\nA designated service area is an area declared by the Minister.\n•\nThe statutory infrastructure provider for a designated service\narea will be a carrier or carriage service provider declared by\nthe Minister.\n\nSchedule 1  Statutory infrastructure providers",
      "skos:definition": "•\nThere are 4 types of service area, as follows:\n(a)\nthe general service area;\n(b)\na nominated service area;\n(c)\nan anticipated service area;\n\nStatutory infrastructure providers  Schedule 1\nAmendments  Part 1\nNo. 36, 2024\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Enhancing Consumer\nSafeguards and Other Measures) Act 2024\n(d)\na designated service area.\n•\nNBN Co is the statutory infrastructure provider for the general\nservice area.\n•\nA nominated service area is an area that is attributable to:\n(a)\na declaration made by a carrier or carriage service\nprovider; or\n(b)\ncertain carrier licence conditions declarations made by\nthe Minister.\n•\nThe statutory infrastructure provider for a nominated service\narea that is attributable to a declaration made by a carrier or\ncarriage service provider will be:\n(a)\nthe carrier or carriage service provider; or\n(b)\nanother carrier or carriage service provider declared by\nthe Minister.\n•\nThe statutory infrastructure provider for a nominated service\narea that is attributable to a carrier licence conditions\ndeclaration will be:\n(a)\nthe carrier to whom the carrier licence conditions\ndeclaration applies; or\n(b)\nanother carrier declared by the Minister.\n•\nAn anticipated service area is an area that is attributable to a\nnotice given by a carrier or carriage service provider.\n•\nThe statutory infrastructure provider for an anticipated service\narea that is attributable to a notice given by a carrier or\ncarriage service provider will be:\n(a)\nthe carrier or carriage service provider; or\n(b)\nanother carrier or carriage service provider declared by\nthe Minister.\n•\nA designated service area is an area declared by the Minister.\n•\nThe statutory infrastructure provider for a designated service\narea will be a carrier or carriage service provider declared by\nthe Minister.\n\nSchedule 1  Statutory infrastructure providers",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-360b-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-360b-logic-alleninterval-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-360b-logic-deontic-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-360b-logic-deontic-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-360b-logic-deontic-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6752e57163c25f6400453eb87a8b95d66fce080335aba934c2aaeec0c1421bd8",
      "skos:note": "Statutory infrastructure providers for different types of service areas"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2024a00036#sch-1-sec-360b",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "360B Simplified outline of this Division",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 12,
      "values:originalText": "•\nThere are 4 types of service area, as follows:\n(a)\nthe general service area;\n(b)\na nominated service area;\n(c)\nan anticipated service area;\n\nStatutory infrastructure providers  Schedule 1\nAmendments  Part 1\nNo. 36, 2024\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Enhancing Consumer\nSafeguards and Other Measures) Act 2024\n(d)\na designated service area.\n•\nNBN Co is the statutory infrastructure provider for the general\nservice area.\n•\nA nominated service area is an area that is attributable to:\n(a)\na declaration made by a carrier or carriage service\nprovider; or\n(b)\ncertain carrier licence conditions declarations made by\nthe Minister.\n•\nThe statutory infrastructure provider for a nominated service\narea that is attributable to a declaration made by a carrier or\ncarriage service provider will be:\n(a)\nthe carrier or carriage service provider; or\n(b)\nanother carrier or carriage service provider declared by\nthe Minister.\n•\nThe statutory infrastructure provider for a nominated service\narea that is attributable to a carrier licence conditions\ndeclaration will be:\n(a)\nthe carrier to whom the carrier licence conditions\ndeclaration applies; or\n(b)\nanother carrier declared by the Minister.\n•\nAn anticipated service area is an area that is attributable to a\nnotice given by a carrier or carriage service provider.\n•\nThe statutory infrastructure provider for an anticipated service\narea that is attributable to a notice given by a carrier or\ncarriage service provider will be:\n(a)\nthe carrier or carriage service provider; or\n(b)\nanother carrier or carriage service provider declared by\nthe Minister.\n•\nA designated service area is an area declared by the Minister.\n•\nThe statutory infrastructure provider for a designated service\narea will be a carrier or carriage service provider declared by\nthe Minister.\n\nSchedule 1  Statutory infrastructure providers"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-360b-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-360b"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-360b-logic-alleninterval-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": ">=",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Temporal intervals for notice giving",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Notice given by a carrier or carriage service provider determines the anticipated service area",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The notice must be given within a certain timeframe to determine the statutory infrastructure provider"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-360b-logic-deontic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "=",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Carrier or carriage service providers are responsible for nominated and anticipated service areas",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The carrier or carriage service provider is declared by the Minister as the statutory infrastructure provider",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The carrier or carriage service provider must provide services within the designated area"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-360b-logic-deontic-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "=",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Minister declares designated service areas and their statutory infrastructure providers",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The Minister has the authority to declare designated service areas",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The Minister must provide information about the designated service area and its statutory infrastructure provider"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-360b-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "=",
      "cml:logicSummary": "NBN Co is the statutory infrastructure provider for general service areas",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "NBN Co is declared as the statutory infrastructure provider for general service areas",
      "cml:conclusionText": "NBN Co must provide services within the designated area"
    },
