    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-25",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "25 At the end of section 360F",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2024a00036#sch-1-sec-25"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2024a00036.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2024a00036.pdf, p.15",
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n(2) For the purposes of this section, if:\n(a) an area (the notice area) is specified in a notice under\nsection 360HA or 360HC; and\n(b) the notice area neither consists of, nor is included in:\n(i) a nominated service area; or\n(ii) a designated service area;\nthen:\n(c) if NBN Co provides qualifying carriage services to end-users\nat one or more premises in the area—so much of the notice\narea as does not include those premises is a pending area; or\n(d) in any other case—the notice area is a pending area.\nNote:\nFor anticipated service areas, see section 360KA.",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\n(2) For the purposes of this section, if:\n(a) an area (the notice area) is specified in a notice under\nsection 360HA or 360HC; and\n(b) the notice area neither consists of, nor is included in:\n(i) a nominated service area; or\n(ii) a designated service area;\nthen:\n(c) if NBN Co provides qualifying carriage services to end-users\nat one or more premises in the area—so much of the notice\narea as does not include those premises is a pending area; or\n(d) in any other case—the notice area is a pending area.\nNote:\nFor anticipated service areas, see section 360KA.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-25-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-25-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-25-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5edb507c5a461509d663934ab5dd23d88af532834f8cfc8456d20981f6a12515",
      "skos:note": "Specify notice area as pending if not included in nominated or designated service areas"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2024a00036#sch-1-sec-25",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "25 At the end of section 360F",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 15,
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n(2) For the purposes of this section, if:\n(a) an area (the notice area) is specified in a notice under\nsection 360HA or 360HC; and\n(b) the notice area neither consists of, nor is included in:\n(i) a nominated service area; or\n(ii) a designated service area;\nthen:\n(c) if NBN Co provides qualifying carriage services to end-users\nat one or more premises in the area—so much of the notice\narea as does not include those premises is a pending area; or\n(d) in any other case—the notice area is a pending area.\nNote:\nFor anticipated service areas, see section 360KA."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-25-norm",
