    {
      "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-53-ss-17",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "53(17) Subsections 360H(14), (15), (16) and (17)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2024a00036#sch-1-sec-53-ss-17"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2024a00036.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2024a00036.pdf, p.18",
      "values:originalText": "(17) The ACMA may, by legislative instrument:\n(a) specify the information that must accompany an application\nunder subsection (15); or\n(b) specify the documents that must accompany an application\nunder subsection (15).\nNote:\nFor variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901.",
      "skos:definition": "(17) The ACMA may, by legislative instrument:\n(a) specify the information that must accompany an application\nunder subsection (15); or\n(b) specify the documents that must accompany an application\nunder subsection (15).\nNote:\nFor variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-53"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-53-ss-17-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "40c05cece8200ed8273fd047fa67881ce1e1ba0f61dd1e243ad7abcaaacb52dd",
      "skos:note": "ACMA may specify information or documents accompanying an application under subsection (15)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2024a00036#sch-1-sec-53-ss-17",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "53(17) Subsections 360H(14), (15), (16) and (17)",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 18,
      "values:originalText": "(17) The ACMA may, by legislative instrument:\n(a) specify the information that must accompany an application\nunder subsection (15); or\n(b) specify the documents that must accompany an application\nunder subsection (15).\nNote:\nFor variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901."
    },
