    {
      "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-53-ss-17a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "53(17A) Subsections 360H(14), (15), (16) and (17)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2024a00036#sch-1-sec-53-ss-17a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2024a00036.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2024a00036.pdf, p.18",
      "values:originalText": "(17A) If, under subsection (14), a carrier varies a declaration made by the\ncarrier under this section, the carrier must:\n(a) give a copy of the variation to the ACMA; and\n(b) do so within 10 business days after making the variation.",
      "skos:definition": "(17A) If, under subsection (14), a carrier varies a declaration made by the\ncarrier under this section, the carrier must:\n(a) give a copy of the variation to the ACMA; and\n(b) do so within 10 business days after making the variation.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-53"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-53-ss-17a-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-53-ss-17a-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "398a5d936ed9e63b377d234ae94da10efa8b720ce198c2622cce9774da46fc70",
      "skos:note": "Carrier must provide variation to ACMA within 10 business days.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2024a00036#sch-1-sec-53-ss-17a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "53(17A) Subsections 360H(14), (15), (16) and (17)",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 18,
      "values:originalText": "(17A) If, under subsection (14), a carrier varies a declaration made by the\ncarrier under this section, the carrier must:\n(a) give a copy of the variation to the ACMA; and\n(b) do so within 10 business days after making the variation."
    },
