    {
      "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-78",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "78 After subsection 360K(1)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2024a00036#sch-1-sec-78"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2024a00036.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2024a00036.pdf, p.32",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\nNominated service area covered by a declaration under\nsection 360HB\n(1A) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n(a) an area is a provisional nominated service area because of a\ndeclaration made by a carriage service provider under\nsection 360HB; and\n(b) the whole or a part of the provisional nominated service area\nis a nominated service area;\nthe carriage service provider is the statutory infrastructure\nprovider for the nominated service area.\n(1B) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that:\n(a) subsection (1A) does not apply to a specified nominated\nservice area; and\n(b) a specified carriage service provider is the statutory\ninfrastructure provider for the nominated service area for the\npurposes of this Part.\nNote:\nFor variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901.",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\nNominated service area covered by a declaration under\nsection 360HB\n(1A) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n(a) an area is a provisional nominated service area because of a\ndeclaration made by a carriage service provider under\nsection 360HB; and\n(b) the whole or a part of the provisional nominated service area\nis a nominated service area;\nthe carriage service provider is the statutory infrastructure\nprovider for the nominated service area.\n(1B) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that:\n(a) subsection (1A) does not apply to a specified nominated\nservice area; and\n(b) a specified carriage service provider is the statutory\ninfrastructure provider for the nominated service area for the\npurposes of this Part.\nNote:\nFor variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-78-ss-1a"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-78-ss-1b"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "228eab51aade547e144a84209f289af6f521a0b0df94a349ccf3f5900faf4f95"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2024a00036#sch-1-sec-78",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "78 After subsection 360K(1)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 32,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\nNominated service area covered by a declaration under\nsection 360HB\n(1A) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n(a) an area is a provisional nominated service area because of a\ndeclaration made by a carriage service provider under\nsection 360HB; and\n(b) the whole or a part of the provisional nominated service area\nis a nominated service area;\nthe carriage service provider is the statutory infrastructure\nprovider for the nominated service area.\n(1B) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that:\n(a) subsection (1A) does not apply to a specified nominated\nservice area; and\n(b) a specified carriage service provider is the statutory\ninfrastructure provider for the nominated service area for the\npurposes of this Part.\nNote:\nFor variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901."
    },
