    {
      "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-360ka",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "360KA Anticipated service area",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2024a00036#sch-1-sec-360ka"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2024a00036.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2024a00036.pdf, p.33",
      "values:originalText": "Area specified in an anticipatory notice given by a carrier\n(1) If:\n(a) a notice is in force under subsection 360HA(1) in relation to\nthe whole or a part of the project area of a real estate\ndevelopment project; and\n(b) the project involves the construction of one or more building\nunits in the area specified in the notice; and\n(c) the following conditions are satisfied in relation to at least\none of those building units:\n(i) the construction of the building unit has been\ncompleted;\n(ii) the building unit is occupied; and\n(d) the area specified in the notice does not consist of, and is not\nincluded in:\n(i) a nominated service area; or\n(ii) a designated service area;\nthe area specified in the notice is an anticipated service area for\nthe purposes of this Part.\nArea specified in an anticipatory notice given by a carriage service\nprovider\n(2) If:\n(a) a notice is in force under subsection 360HC(1) in relation to\nthe whole or a part of the project area of a real estate\ndevelopment project; and\n(b) the project involves the construction of one or more building\nunits in the area specified in the notice; and\n\nSchedule 1  Statutory infrastructure providers",
      "skos:definition": "Area specified in an anticipatory notice given by a carrier\n(1) If:\n(a) a notice is in force under subsection 360HA(1) in relation to\nthe whole or a part of the project area of a real estate\ndevelopment project; and\n(b) the project involves the construction of one or more building\nunits in the area specified in the notice; and\n(c) the following conditions are satisfied in relation to at least\none of those building units:\n(i) the construction of the building unit has been\ncompleted;\n(ii) the building unit is occupied; and\n(d) the area specified in the notice does not consist of, and is not\nincluded in:\n(i) a nominated service area; or\n(ii) a designated service area;\nthe area specified in the notice is an anticipated service area for\nthe purposes of this Part.\nArea specified in an anticipatory notice given by a carriage service\nprovider\n(2) If:\n(a) a notice is in force under subsection 360HC(1) in relation to\nthe whole or a part of the project area of a real estate\ndevelopment project; and\n(b) the project involves the construction of one or more building\nunits in the area specified in the notice; and\n\nSchedule 1  Statutory infrastructure providers",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-360ka-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-360ka-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9ecd16a228bf741d70f3c6cc6375e99a028fc547546c93e9dc6493976ee37123"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2024a00036#sch-1-sec-360ka",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "360KA Anticipated service area",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 33,
      "values:originalText": "Area specified in an anticipatory notice given by a carrier\n(1) If:\n(a) a notice is in force under subsection 360HA(1) in relation to\nthe whole or a part of the project area of a real estate\ndevelopment project; and\n(b) the project involves the construction of one or more building\nunits in the area specified in the notice; and\n(c) the following conditions are satisfied in relation to at least\none of those building units:\n(i) the construction of the building unit has been\ncompleted;\n(ii) the building unit is occupied; and\n(d) the area specified in the notice does not consist of, and is not\nincluded in:\n(i) a nominated service area; or\n(ii) a designated service area;\nthe area specified in the notice is an anticipated service area for\nthe purposes of this Part.\nArea specified in an anticipatory notice given by a carriage service\nprovider\n(2) If:\n(a) a notice is in force under subsection 360HC(1) in relation to\nthe whole or a part of the project area of a real estate\ndevelopment project; and\n(b) the project involves the construction of one or more building\nunits in the area specified in the notice; and\n\nSchedule 1  Statutory infrastructure providers"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-360ka-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "360KA(1) Anticipated service area",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2024a00036#sch-1-sec-360ka-ss-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
