      "skos:note": "Statutory infrastructure provider for an anticipated service area if specified in a notice."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2024a00036#sch-1-sec-360kb-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "360KB(3) Statutory infrastructure provider for an anticipated service",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 34,
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of this Part, if:\n\nStatutory infrastructure providers  Schedule 1\nAmendments  Part 1\nNo. 36, 2024\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Enhancing Consumer\nSafeguards and Other Measures) Act 2024\n(a) an area is specified in a notice given by a carriage service\nprovider under subsection 360HC(1) in relation to a real\nestate development project; and\n(b) the area is an anticipated service area;\nthe carriage service provider is the statutory infrastructure\nprovider for the anticipated service area."
    },
