    {
      "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-360kb-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "360KB(4) Statutory infrastructure provider for an anticipated service",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2024a00036#sch-1-sec-360kb-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2024a00036.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2024a00036.pdf, p.34",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that:\n(a) subsection (3) does not apply to a specified anticipated\nservice area; and\n(b) a specified carriage service provider is the statutory\ninfrastructure provider for the anticipated service area for\nthe purposes of this Part.\nNote:\nFor variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that:\n(a) subsection (3) does not apply to a specified anticipated\nservice area; and\n(b) a specified carriage service provider is the statutory\ninfrastructure provider for the anticipated service area for\nthe purposes of this Part.\nNote:\nFor variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-360kb"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-360kb-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-360kb-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "eccb554c1e9909a44048f14d97ed3c3232dbcf743da60d807dc45f8248a2e17e",
      "skos:note": "Declare specified anticipated service area and carriage service provider."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2024a00036#sch-1-sec-360kb-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "360KB(4) Statutory infrastructure provider for an anticipated service",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 34,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, declare that:\n(a) subsection (3) does not apply to a specified anticipated\nservice area; and\n(b) a specified carriage service provider is the statutory\ninfrastructure provider for the anticipated service area for\nthe purposes of this Part.\nNote:\nFor variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901."
    },
