      "dc:source": "c2024a00036.pdf, p.42",
      "values:originalText": "(2A) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that, if the\nconditions specified in the determination are satisfied, the statutory\ninfrastructure provider for the service area specified in the\ndetermination is taken to have complied with the statutory\ninfrastructure provider’s obligations under subsection (1) in\nrelation to the service area.\nNote:\nFor variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901.",
      "skos:definition": "(2A) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that, if the\nconditions specified in the determination are satisfied, the statutory\ninfrastructure provider for the service area specified in the\ndetermination is taken to have complied with the statutory\ninfrastructure provider’s obligations under subsection (1) in\nrelation to the service area.\nNote:\nFor variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-110"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-110-ss-2a-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-110-ss-2a-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "20d94c6c28dd7302f05d5986336b3d7906cc751802f8f1ee71c8b21d0e75dc10",
      "skos:note": "The Minister may determine that a statutory infrastructure provider complies with its obligations."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2024a00036#sch-1-sec-110-ss-2a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "110(2A) Subsections 360Q(2) and (2A)",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 42,
      "values:originalText": "(2A) The Minister may, by legislative instrument, determine that, if the\nconditions specified in the determination are satisfied, the statutory\ninfrastructure provider for the service area specified in the\ndetermination is taken to have complied with the statutory\ninfrastructure provider’s obligations under subsection (1) in\nrelation to the service area.\nNote:\nFor variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts\nInterpretation Act 1901."
    },
