      "dc:source": "c2024a00036.pdf, p.44",
      "values:originalText": "(11) If a carriage service provider makes a request as mentioned in\nsubsection (1):\n(a) the statutory infrastructure provider must:\n(i) notify the carriage service provider that the statutory\ninfrastructure provider will fulfil the request; or\n(ii) refuse the request; and\n(b) do so within:\n(i) 10 business days after receiving the request; or\n(ii) if a longer period is specified under subsection (12)—\nthat longer period.",
      "skos:definition": "(11) If a carriage service provider makes a request as mentioned in\nsubsection (1):\n(a) the statutory infrastructure provider must:\n(i) notify the carriage service provider that the statutory\ninfrastructure provider will fulfil the request; or\n(ii) refuse the request; and\n(b) do so within:\n(i) 10 business days after receiving the request; or\n(ii) if a longer period is specified under subsection (12)—\nthat longer period.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-119"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
