        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-119-ss-11-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "700d72d513cbd6485cf67e1647f7bb97e79eab476feef01ca7203b95a9df9482",
      "skos:note": "Statutory infrastructure provider must notify or refuse request within 10 business days.",
      "dc:description": "true"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2024a00036#sch-1-sec-119-ss-11",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "119(11) At the end of section 360Q",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 44,
      "values:originalText": "(11) If a carriage service provider makes a request as mentioned in\nsubsection (1):\n(a) the statutory infrastructure provider must:\n(i) notify the carriage service provider that the statutory\ninfrastructure provider will fulfil the request; or\n(ii) refuse the request; and\n(b) do so within:\n(i) 10 business days after receiving the request; or\n(ii) if a longer period is specified under subsection (12)—\nthat longer period."
    },
