    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-142-ss-16",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "142(16) At the end of section 360U",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2024a00036#sch-1-sec-142-ss-16"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2024a00036.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2024a00036.pdf, p.50",
      "values:originalText": "(16) However, a statutory infrastructure provider is not required to\ncomply with a benchmark set under subsection (11) to the extent\nthat the benchmark is inconsistent with an access agreement to\nwhich the statutory infrastructure provider is a party, so long as:\n(a) the agreement was entered into before the commencement of\nthe benchmark; and\n(b) the agreement has not been varied after the commencement\nof the benchmark.",
      "skos:definition": "(16) However, a statutory infrastructure provider is not required to\ncomply with a benchmark set under subsection (11) to the extent\nthat the benchmark is inconsistent with an access agreement to\nwhich the statutory infrastructure provider is a party, so long as:\n(a) the agreement was entered into before the commencement of\nthe benchmark; and\n(b) the agreement has not been varied after the commencement\nof the benchmark.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-142"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-142-ss-16-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-142-ss-16-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-142-ss-16-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-142-ss-16-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-142-ss-16-logic-deontic-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e15204792a54963173ca3225647493940e0f0a80d43bfd653e17054fab88b254",
      "skos:note": "Not required to comply with a benchmark if it's inconsistent with an access agreement entered into before the benchmark's commencement."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2024a00036#sch-1-sec-142-ss-16",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "142(16) At the end of section 360U",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 50,
      "values:originalText": "(16) However, a statutory infrastructure provider is not required to\ncomply with a benchmark set under subsection (11) to the extent\nthat the benchmark is inconsistent with an access agreement to\nwhich the statutory infrastructure provider is a party, so long as:\n(a) the agreement was entered into before the commencement of\nthe benchmark; and\n(b) the agreement has not been varied after the commencement\nof the benchmark."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-142-ss-16-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-142-ss-16"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-142-ss-16-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "exemption",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Exemption from compliance with a benchmark",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Benchmark is inconsistent with an access agreement",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Statutory infrastructure provider is not required to comply"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-142-ss-16-logic-alleninterval-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "during",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Benchmark's commencement is during the access agreement's validity",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Access agreement was entered into before the benchmark's commencement",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Benchmark's applicability is limited by the access agreement's duration"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-142-ss-16-logic-ltl-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LTL"
      },
      "cml:operator": "until",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Benchmark's applicability ends when the access agreement is varied after its commencement",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::temporal_ltl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Access agreement has not been varied after the benchmark's commencement",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Benchmark's applicability is limited by the access agreement's duration"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-142-ss-16-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "permission",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Statutory infrastructure provider has permission to deviate from the benchmark if it's inconsistent with an access agreement",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Benchmark is inconsistent with an access agreement",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Statutory infrastructure provider can choose not to comply with the benchmark"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-143",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "143 After paragraph 360V(1)(a)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2024a00036#sch-1-sec-143"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2024a00036.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2024a00036.pdf, p.51",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n(aa) the terms and conditions (whether or not relating to price or a\nmethod of ascertaining price) of the supply of an eligible\nservice to a carriage service provider in order that the\ncarriage service provider can provide qualifying carriage\nservices to an end-user at premises in a relevant service area;",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\n(aa) the terms and conditions (whether or not relating to price or a\nmethod of ascertaining price) of the supply of an eligible\nservice to a carriage service provider in order that the\ncarriage service provider can provide qualifying carriage\nservices to an end-user at premises in a relevant service area;",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-143-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-143-logic-alleninterval-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "bbc88be83b75ab9c8a7a29e22dc0e6f4b9ed0487730ef9cfc78979400f8b6d88",
      "skos:note": "Terms and conditions for supply of eligible service to carriage service provider"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2024a00036#sch-1-sec-143",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "143 After paragraph 360V(1)(a)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 51,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n(aa) the terms and conditions (whether or not relating to price or a\nmethod of ascertaining price) of the supply of an eligible\nservice to a carriage service provider in order that the\ncarriage service provider can provide qualifying carriage\nservices to an end-user at premises in a relevant service area;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-143-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-143"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-143-logic-alleninterval-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Applicable",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Identifies temporal interval for supply of eligible service",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Supply of eligible service occurs at a specific time",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Temporal interval identified"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-144",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "144 At the end of subsection 360V(1)",
