      "dc:source": "c2024a00036.pdf, p.53",
      "values:originalText": "or designated compensable rule\n(1) If:\n(a) a statutory infrastructure provider contravenes a designated\ncompensable standard; and\n(b) the standard is determined under subsection 360U(1); and\n\nSchedule 1  Statutory infrastructure providers",
      "skos:definition": "or designated compensable rule\n(1) If:\n(a) a statutory infrastructure provider contravenes a designated\ncompensable standard; and\n(b) the standard is determined under subsection 360U(1); and\n\nSchedule 1  Statutory infrastructure providers",
      "cml:asserts": [
