      "dc:source": "c2024a00036.pdf, p.55",
      "values:originalText": "(2) In making a decision under subsection (1), the statutory\ninfrastructure provider must have regard to whether there is any\nreasonable basis for the statutory infrastructure provider to dispute\nthe liability.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) In making a decision under subsection (1), the statutory\ninfrastructure provider must have regard to whether there is any\nreasonable basis for the statutory infrastructure provider to dispute\nthe liability.",
      "values:partOf": {
