      "dc:source": "c2024a00036.pdf, p.58",
      "values:originalText": "(3) This Division does not limit, restrict or otherwise affect the\noperation of the Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman\nscheme. In particular, this Division does not affect a customer’s\nright to complain to the Telecommunications Industry\nOmbudsman.",
