      "values:originalText": "(3) If a compliance audit of a statutory infrastructure provider is being\nconducted by the ACMA, the statutory infrastructure provider\nmust:\n(a) cooperate fully with the ACMA in relation to the compliance\naudit; and\n(b) provide the ACMA with all reasonable facilities and\nassistance in relation to the compliance audit."
