      "skos:definition": "(5) If an area specified in a notice given under a provision mentioned\nin paragraph (1)(c) consists of, or is included in, an anticipated\nservice area, the ACMA may:\n(a) annotate the copy of the notice that is included in the\nRegister with a statement to the effect that the area specified\nin the notice consists of, or is included in, a specified\nanticipated service area; or\n(b) remove the notice from the Register.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-163"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-163-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-1-sec-163-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9db9d2f3cf22b8d67707a52da2cfe18df2b9c06a799764e8b1611bd2957d4694",
      "skos:note": "Annotate or remove notice from Register"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2024a00036#sch-1-sec-163-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "163(5) At the end of section 360Z",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 64,
      "values:originalText": "(5) If an area specified in a notice given under a provision mentioned\nin paragraph (1)(c) consists of, or is included in, an anticipated\nservice area, the ACMA may:\n(a) annotate the copy of the notice that is included in the\nRegister with a statement to the effect that the area specified\nin the notice consists of, or is included in, a specified\nanticipated service area; or\n(b) remove the notice from the Register."
    },
