      "skos:note": "The scheme may provide for the Telecommunications Industry Ombudsman to investigate and make determinations relating to complaints about the connection of premises to a qualifying telecommunications network."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2024a00036#sch-1-sec-167-ss-5a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "167(5A) After subsection 128(5)",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 67,
      "values:originalText": "(5A) The scheme may also provide for the Telecommunications Industry\nOmbudsman to:\n(a) investigate; and\n(b) make determinations relating to; and\n(c) give directions relating to;\ncomplaints about the connection of premises to a qualifying\ntelecommunications network, where the connection is:\n(d) by a statutory infrastructure provider for a service area; and\n(e) in order that a carriage service provider can provide\nqualifying carriage services to an end-user at premises in the\nservice area."
    },
