      "skos:note": "Remedial notice must state certain information about a potential contravention.",
      "dc:description": "information about the provision being, has been, or is likely to be contravened"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2024a00036#sch-2-sec-372jb-ss-1",
