      "skos:note": "Must disclose information to Secretary or APS employee upon request.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2024a00036#sch-3-sec-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1 After subsection 59B(1)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 75,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n(1A) For the purpose of advising the Minister, an ACMA official must,\nif requested to do so by:\n(a) the Secretary of the Department; or\n(b) an APS employee in the Department who is authorised, in\nwriting, by the Secretary of the Department for the purposes\nof this subsection;\ndisclose authorised disclosure information to the Secretary of the\nDepartment or the APS employee, as the case requires."
    },
