      "dc:source": "c2024a00036.pdf, p.75",
      "values:originalText": "(6) Subsection (5) does not, by implication, limit what can be\ndisclosed under a provision of this Part other than this section.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) Subsection (5) does not, by implication, limit what can be\ndisclosed under a provision of this Part other than this section.",
