    {
      "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-3-sec-59da-ss-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "59DA(8) Disclosure of information that relates to the affairs of a",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2024a00036#sch-3-sec-59da-ss-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2024a00036.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2024a00036.pdf, p.75",
      "values:originalText": "(8) For the purposes of this section:\n(a) an ACMA official authorised by the Chair, in writing, for the\npurposes of this section is taken to disclose information if the\ninformation is published by the ACMA:\n(i) on the ACMA’s website; or\n(ii) in any other way; and\n(b) an ACMA official authorised by the Chair, in writing, for the\npurposes of this section is taken to disclose summaries or\nstatistics if the summaries or statistics are published by the\nACMA:\n(i) on the ACMA’s website; or\n(ii) in any other way.",
      "skos:definition": "(8) For the purposes of this section:\n(a) an ACMA official authorised by the Chair, in writing, for the\npurposes of this section is taken to disclose information if the\ninformation is published by the ACMA:\n(i) on the ACMA’s website; or\n(ii) in any other way; and\n(b) an ACMA official authorised by the Chair, in writing, for the\npurposes of this section is taken to disclose summaries or\nstatistics if the summaries or statistics are published by the\nACMA:\n(i) on the ACMA’s website; or\n(ii) in any other way.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-3-sec-59da"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-3-sec-59da-ss-8-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-3-sec-59da-ss-8-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4c5b7f09fb08a1143205b020a6d3634b0155a69775961e360e14f76b77c996ce",
      "skos:note": "Disclosure of information is permitted if published by ACMA"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2024a00036#sch-3-sec-59da-ss-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "59DA(8) Disclosure of information that relates to the affairs of a",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 75,
      "values:originalText": "(8) For the purposes of this section:\n(a) an ACMA official authorised by the Chair, in writing, for the\npurposes of this section is taken to disclose information if the\ninformation is published by the ACMA:\n(i) on the ACMA’s website; or\n(ii) in any other way; and\n(b) an ACMA official authorised by the Chair, in writing, for the\npurposes of this section is taken to disclose summaries or\nstatistics if the summaries or statistics are published by the\nACMA:\n(i) on the ACMA’s website; or\n(ii) in any other way."
    },
