      "values:originalText": "Add:\n(2) For the purposes of this section, an ACMA official is taken to\ndisclose information if the information is published by the ACMA:\n(a) on the ACMA’s website; or\n(b) in any other way.\n(3) Subsection (2) is enacted for the avoidance of doubt.",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\n(2) For the purposes of this section, an ACMA official is taken to\ndisclose information if the information is published by the ACMA:\n(a) on the ACMA’s website; or\n(b) in any other way.\n(3) Subsection (2) is enacted for the avoidance of doubt.",
