    {
      "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-4-sec-14-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "14(5) At the end of section 12D",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2024a00036#sch-4-sec-14-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2024a00036.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2024a00036.pdf, p.80",
      "values:originalText": "(5) The following provisions have effect:\n(a) subsection (1) does not prevent the Minister from making a\ndetermination under subsection 12A(2A) that each of 2 or\nmore persons is a primary universal service provider for a\nservice area in respect of a service obligation;\n(b) if such a determination is in force—that area is a special\ndetermined area in relation to that service obligation.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) The following provisions have effect:\n(a) subsection (1) does not prevent the Minister from making a\ndetermination under subsection 12A(2A) that each of 2 or\nmore persons is a primary universal service provider for a\nservice area in respect of a service obligation;\n(b) if such a determination is in force—that area is a special\ndetermined area in relation to that service obligation.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-4-sec-14"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-4-sec-14-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-4-sec-14-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "593060de527021f063c262bdc0c6f52508de50b20a86e2e1fc2b7dd9ede05334",
      "skos:note": "Minister can make determination about primary universal service provider"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2024a00036#sch-4-sec-14-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "14(5) At the end of section 12D",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 80,
      "values:originalText": "(5) The following provisions have effect:\n(a) subsection (1) does not prevent the Minister from making a\ndetermination under subsection 12A(2A) that each of 2 or\nmore persons is a primary universal service provider for a\nservice area in respect of a service obligation;\n(b) if such a determination is in force—that area is a special\ndetermined area in relation to that service obligation."
    },
