      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2024a00036.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2024a00036.pdf, p.80",
      "values:originalText": "(6) The following provisions have effect:\n(a) subsection (1) does not prevent the Minister from making a\ndetermination under subsection 12A(1) that a person (other\nthan Telstra Limited) is the primary universal service\nprovider for the general Australian service area in respect of\na service obligation;\n(b) if such a determination is in force—subsection (1) does not\napply to that service obligation.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) The following provisions have effect:\n(a) subsection (1) does not prevent the Minister from making a\ndetermination under subsection 12A(1) that a person (other\nthan Telstra Limited) is the primary universal service\nprovider for the general Australian service area in respect of\na service obligation;\n(b) if such a determination is in force—subsection (1) does not\napply to that service obligation.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-4-sec-14"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-4-sec-14-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-4-sec-14-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
