    {
      "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-5-sec-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "7 Application—amendments of section 570 of the",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2024a00036#sch-5-sec-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "c2024a00036.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "c2024a00036.pdf, p.84",
      "values:originalText": "Telecommunications Act 1997\nThe amendments of section 570 of the Telecommunications Act 1997\nmade by this Schedule apply in relation to a contravention of a civil\npenalty provision if the conduct constituting the contravention of the\nprovision occurs wholly on or after the day this item commences.\n\nTechnical amendments  Schedule 5\n\nNo. 36, 2024\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Enhancing Consumer\nSafeguards and Other Measures) Act 2024",
      "skos:definition": "Telecommunications Act 1997\nThe amendments of section 570 of the Telecommunications Act 1997\nmade by this Schedule apply in relation to a contravention of a civil\npenalty provision if the conduct constituting the contravention of the\nprovision occurs wholly on or after the day this item commences.\n\nTechnical amendments  Schedule 5\n\nNo. 36, 2024\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Enhancing Consumer\nSafeguards and Other Measures) Act 2024",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-5-sec-7-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-5-sec-7-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9ed2e5065c7721b87023590f0747bc4d15d8a6daf735ad6952124e8fb751ef7d",
      "skos:note": "Amendments of section 570 of the Telecommunications Act 1997 apply to contraventions of civil penalty provisions occurring after commencement."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/c2024a00036#sch-5-sec-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "7 Application—amendments of section 570 of the",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 84,
      "values:originalText": "Telecommunications Act 1997\nThe amendments of section 570 of the Telecommunications Act 1997\nmade by this Schedule apply in relation to a contravention of a civil\npenalty provision if the conduct constituting the contravention of the\nprovision occurs wholly on or after the day this item commences.\n\nTechnical amendments  Schedule 5\n\nNo. 36, 2024\nTelecommunications Legislation Amendment (Enhancing Consumer\nSafeguards and Other Measures) Act 2024"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-5-sec-7-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:c2024a00036-sch-5-sec-7"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
